# Armagetron cleanup

## Keep (coupled to live multiplayer)

- `src/network/` server browser, master queries, game protocol
- Dedicated server build path (`--enable-dedicated`) unless explicitly removing server support
- Map XML parsing (`gParser.cpp` + libxml2)

## Safe to remove or gate

- Root `.cbp` CodeBlocks projects (autotools/docker supersede them)
- Orphan `leftover.cpp`, `prototype.cpp` if unused
- Krawall/ZThread when `--disable-armathentication` (macOS default in `build-macos.sh`)
- Docker deploy targets not in use (PPA matrix, Flatpak, itch, etc.)
- `accustomdir.m4` install machinery for dev-only macOS builds

## Dependency ladder (prefer top)

1. Homebrew system packages (`sdl12-compat`, `libpng`, `libxml2` after nanohttp removal)
2. `_deps/` only for what Homebrew cannot ship (SDL_image 1.2 on macOS)
3. Do not add SDL2 until a deliberate migration — engine is SDL 1.2 throughout `src/render/`

## macOS dev canonical path

`./build-macos.sh` → `src/armagetronad_main` → `make run`. Align `configure_for_bundle.sh` with same flags.

## When simplifying

- Prefer `#ifdef` removal via configure gates over deleting protocol code
- One subsystem per PR; verify `make -C src` after each change
- Update `docs/DEVLOG.md` briefly after each change
